Description: Yoriito Signal level Vehicle API
 Provides the Yoriito Signal API, the signal-level vehicle abstraction of the
 Yoriito Vehicle API. It builds on top of the Yoriito common library and the
 VISS client/server components and exposes its shared library and headers under
 /usr/lib/yoriito and /usr/include/yoriito.
